<title>FRANCE: Club Med appoints deputy managing director.</title>
<headline>Club Med appoints deputy managing director.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Club Mediterranee said on Wednesday that Henri Giscard d'Estaing had been appointed deputy managing director with responsibility for finance, development and international relations -- a new post created by chairman Philippe Bourguignon.</p>
<p>Giscard d'Estaing was previously director of the mineral waters branch of food group Danone and managing director of Britain's HP-Lea &amp; Perrins Ltd before that, Club Med said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
